If you had investigated =97 if you had done your job =97 you would have fou=
nd this email. You would have seen a volunteer attempting reconciliation in=
 good faith after being subjected to managerial intimidation.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, Apto=
