Instead, you weaponized confidential disclosures from my supervisor. You is=
sued a permanent ban explicitly citing my protected speech. You ignored the=
ir documented abuse and punished me for naming it.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, Apto=
s_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-s=
ize: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
You are protecting abusers. This is black and white.</div>
<div style=3D"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-family: Aptos, Apto=
s_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-s=
